 msgctxt "#32318"
-msgid "Your @DISTRONAME@ installation is now complete and you are about to enter Kodi where you can set up your media libraries. For help with this, there is a guide available at wiki.kodi.tv[CR][CR]@DISTRONAME@ is developed by a dedicated team of developers who work purely in their spare time. Even as a volunteer project, we still have to pay for our internet bandwidth and development resources so if you find @DISTRONAME@ useful we will always appreciate a donation of any amount.[CR][CR]Finally, we hope you enjoy using @DISTRONAME@ as much as we've enjoyed building it. If you need any more help, you can find links to our support forum along with latest news at our website."
-msgstr "Инсталацията на @DISTRONAME@ приключи и сега ще бъдете пренасочени към Kodi, където ще можете да настроите медийните си библиотеки. При необходимост от помощ можете да ползвате ръководството на www.wiki.kodi.tv[CR][CR]@DISTRONAME@ се развива от малък екип разработчици, в свободното им време. Въпреки, че е проект на доброволчески начала се налага да се плаща за интернет трафика и разходи свързани с развойната дейност. Затова ако намирате @DISTRONAME@ за полезна програма ние ще оценим и най-малкото дарение.[CR][CR]Надяваме се, че ще се насладите на @DISTRONAME@, поне толкова колкото ние се наслаждавахме докато го създавахме. Ако Ви е необходима помощ ще я намерите (и новини) на нашия уеб сайт."
+msgid "Your @DISTRONAME@ Hades installation is now complete and you are about to enter its media centre, where you can set up your media libraries. The media centre is Kodi with changes, and Kodi's guide applies to it: kodi.wiki[CR][CR]@DISTRONAME@ Hades is an unofficial build of @DISTRONAME@. Team @DISTRONAME@ and Team Kodi do not make or support it: if you need help, look for it where this build is published, not in their forums.[CR][CR]It is built entirely on their work, which volunteers do in their spare time. If you find it useful, a donation to them is what helps: libreelec.tv and kodi.tv/donate"
+msgstr "Your @DISTRONAME@ Hades installation is now complete and you are about to enter its media centre, where you can set up your media libraries. The media centre is Kodi with changes, and Kodi's guide applies to it: kodi.wiki[CR][CR]@DISTRONAME@ Hades is an unofficial build of @DISTRONAME@. Team @DISTRONAME@ and Team Kodi do not make or support it: if you need help, look for it where this build is published, not in their forums.[CR][CR]It is built entirely on their work, which volunteers do in their spare time. If you find it useful, a donation to them is what helps: libreelec.tv and kodi.tv/donate"
 
