+msgid "@DISTRONAME@ Hades has temporarily started in safe mode because its media centre failed to start several times in a row.[CR][CR]You may now investigate the cause by enabling ssh or Samba.[CR][CR]Your original settings and add-ons can be reached in \"/storage/.kodi.FAILED\" and in the Samba \"Kodi-Failed\" share.[CR][CR]Rebooting will return to them.[CR][CR]If you need help, look for it where this build is published, not in the forum of LibreELEC: this is not LibreELEC's build. The crash log can be viewed with the crash log option in Settings > LibreELEC > System > Submit Log."
+msgstr "@DISTRONAME@ Hades has temporarily started in safe mode because its media centre failed to start several times in a row.[CR][CR]You may now investigate the cause by enabling ssh or Samba.[CR][CR]Your original settings and add-ons can be reached in \"/storage/.kodi.FAILED\" and in the Samba \"Kodi-Failed\" share.[CR][CR]Rebooting will return to them.[CR][CR]If you need help, look for it where this build is published, not in the forum of LibreELEC: this is not LibreELEC's build. The crash log can be viewed with the crash log option in Settings > LibreELEC > System > Submit Log."
 
