+msgid "[B]This is LibreELEC Hades[/B], an unofficial build of LibreELEC. Team LibreELEC does not make or support it: please look for help where this build is published, not in LibreELEC's forum.[CR][CR][B]LibreELEC[/B], which it is built on:[CR]https://libreelec.tv[CR][CR][B]Its code[/B] can be found on GitHub:[CR]https://github.com/LibreELEC[CR][CR][B]Donations[/B] towards its expenses are accepted via OpenCollective:[CR]https://opencollective.com/libreelec/donate"
